<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Travelers/Aetna started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Travelers/Aetna started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Harry Fong initiated coverage of Travelers/Aetna Property Casualty Corp with an accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $2.10 per share for 1996, and $2.65 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 33-7/8.  </p>
<p>-- Fong also started coverage of Travelers Group Inc with a buy rating and estimated earnings of $3.25 per share for 1996 and $3.65 for 1997.</p>
</text>
